<div class="product-features-banner">
  <div class="page-width product-features-banner__inner">
    <div class="product-features-banner__content">
      <h2>Key Features for the Professional Station</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Unrivaled Durability:</strong> Heavy-duty frame construction: Fabricated with robust structural components to withstand high-volume usage.</li>
        <li><strong>Articulated Positioning:</strong> Manual adjustment architecture: Precision-balanced backrest and leg rest assemblies.</li>
        <li><strong>Seamless Integration:</strong> Sleek aesthetic profile: Clean lines and versatile color options that complement clinic environments.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="product-features-banner__media">
      <div class="product-features-banner__img-placeholder"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
.product-features-banner { background-color: #a22938; color: #fff; padding: 4rem 0; margin: 4rem 0; }
.product-features-banner__inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: center; }
.product-features-banner__content h2 { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
.product-features-banner__content ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
.product-features-banner__content li { margin-bottom: 1.25rem; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5; }
.product-features-banner__media { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4/3; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; }
.product-features-banner__img-placeholder { width: 100%; height: 100%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); }
@media (max-width: 767px) { .product-features-banner__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>

